{
  "model": "medium",
  "language": "en",
  "text": "Hello everyone! Thanks for coming to our presentation. Our new app does lots of things to help busy people. It's like a normal map on your smartphone, but a lot better. On a map, the directions sometimes look good, but the map doesn't know that the roads are busy with cars or that there are other problems. Our map is different. People who use our app can send information about problems, like traffic jams. Let me show you how it works. Look at this screenshot. We are here, and my favorite Italian restaurant is there. But there's a traffic jam here because of some roadworks. So these are the best directions to the restaurant. It takes just 15 minutes to go there by car. Also, this app learns a lot about you. It knows what kinds of food you like and what time of day you usually eat. And it learns about what cafes and restaurants are popular with other people where you live. It sends you messages when you are near these places and shows you their location. Just in time for lunch. Finally, do you sometimes wait for your friends? It's bad when you don't know where they are. Well, with this app, just share your locations with each other, and the app can send messages to you. The messages tell you if your friends are on time or if they are late. It tells you how many more minutes before they arrive. This is good when your friends are in a car or on a bike and don't want to stop to use their phones. Our app is easy to use. Just download it to your phone and start using it today.",
